          "speaker_role": "Managing Director at General Catalyst",
          "rationale": "General Catalyst认为创始团队在快速转型和执行上展现出信念与执行力，Melius已构建真正的操作系统，让智能体完成从初稿到成品的完整工作流，随着AI智能体能力增强，全工作流优势将不断累积。",
          "quote": "Watching Joowon, Young, and Arnav pivot and execute at speed showed exactly the kind of conviction and execution we look for in founders. While most generative AI tools for creative teams are single-purpose — a prompt box here, an editor there — Melius has now built a true operating system where agents can take a workflow from first draft to finished asset. As AI agents get more capable, that full-workflow is where the advantage will compound",
